# A corrupted autosave is not a dead end: Continue says it cannot be loaded and turns into "Discard autosave".
# Layout (1400x800): with an autosave the menu column is Continue (150,220), Versus (150,280) ...; Back on the mode list (700,712).
wait 20
slot 0 ../records/corrupt.5dr   # a record that looks fine from outside but whose move is illegal
wait 5
click 150 250        # Versus: leave the menu so that it is rebuilt with the autosave
wait 30
click 700 712        # Back
wait 40
click 150 220        # Continue
wait 20
capture discard-cannot-load   # "This save can't be loaded", the top button now reads "Discard autosave"
click 150 220        # Discard autosave
wait 40
capture discard-after         # the menu is back to its first item Versus
